    "site_desc": "This site is located on a Delta peat island in a cornfield that is left fallow during the non-growing season. Peat is roughly 2 meters thick in this area and soil organic matter  ranges from 10 to 30%. Three soil types dominate this site:  Peltier Mucky Clay Loam, Rindge Muck, and Rindge Mucky Silt Loam.  Crop management was consistent for 25 years prior to and during the measurement period. The field was fertilized twice and irrigated twice during the growing season.",
